{"version":2,"width":100,"height":30,"timestamp":1793906824,"idle_time_limit":2.0,"command":"bash examples/multi-hop-demo/run.sh","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[0.009975, "o", "building (first run takes a while)...\r\n"]
[1.088, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== Setup\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.088007, "o", "\u001b[2m# attenuo at http://127.0.0.1:58247 proxies a fake GitHub MCP server at port 58248 as 'github'.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.088031, "o", "\u001b[2m# Policy: reads anywhere in acme/, writes only to agent/* branches, never to main. See policy.cedar.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.088033, "o", "\u001b[2m# The policy's tests run offline first (policy_test.yaml).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.088066, "o", "$ attenuo policy test examples/multi-hop-demo/policy_test.yaml\r\n"]
[1.72422, "o", "examples/multi-hop-demo/policy_test.yaml\r\n  ✓ the coder reads a file in acme/api  (allow: policy_allow [read_in_acme])\r\n  ✓ the coder's write to main is refused by policy, though its token allows the write  (deny: policy_deny [no_writes_to_default_branch])\r\n  ✓ a read of a second acme/api repository passes policy (the server's run limit refuses it)  (allow: policy_allow [read_in_acme])\r\n  ✓ the coder cannot open issues, the planner did not delegate create_issue  (deny: capability_denied)\r\n  ✓ the coder cannot read acme repositories outside acme/api  (deny: capability_denied)\r\n  ✓ the coder cannot list issues, even in acme/api  (deny: capability_denied)\r\n  ✓ the coder may write to an agent branch  (allow: policy_allow [write_to_agent_branches])\r\n"]
[1.724225, "o", "  ✓ the planner reads issues across acme  (allow: policy_allow [read_in_acme])\r\n  ✓ the planner opens an issue in acme  (allow: policy_allow [open_issues_in_acme])\r\n  ✓ the planner's token stops at the acme organisation  (deny: capability_denied)\r\n  ✓ reads outside acme get no permit  (deny: policy_deny)\r\n"]
[1.724227, "o", "  ✓ a write without a branch is refused  (deny: policy_deny [no_writes_to_default_branch])\r\n"]
[1.724239, "o", "  ✓ a write to master is refused like one to main  (deny: policy_deny [no_writes_to_default_branch])\r\n  ✓ a third agent below the coder is refused even for a read  (deny: policy_deny [forbid_chains_past_the_coder])\r\n\r\n14 passed, 0 failed (14 cases in 1 file)\r\nall 5 policies exercised\r\n"]
[1.724441, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 1. Exchange 1, alice -> planner: the planner's root token (hop 1)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.724461, "o", "\u001b[2m# Read files and issues, open issues and write files, all only under acme/. may_act: only the\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.724465, "o", "\u001b[2m# coder may exchange this token. (The dev mint stands in for an OIDC ID token at POST /token.)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.724494, "o", "$ attenuo token root --subject alice --agent planner --may-act coder\r\n"]
[1.737126, "o", "lease       acac0825-a30c-4a56-a6ce-f78769186eb5\r\nexpires_in  900s\r\n"]
[1.737204, "o", "token       eyJ0eXAiOiJhdHRlbnVvK2p3...\r\n"]
[1.742233, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 2. The planner looks at the issues it was asked to plan for: allowed\u001b[0m\r\n$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$PLANNER\" attenuo call --server github --tool list_issues --arg repo=acme/api\r\n"]
[1.757287, "o", "ALLOWED\r\n{\"arguments\":{\"repo\":\"acme/api\"},\"name\":\"list_issues\"}\r\n"]
[1.76, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 3. Refused exchange: the coder asks for get_file_contents on any repository\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.760018, "o", "\u001b[2m# The coder authenticates as itself (its secret on stdin). The parent's last hop covers\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.760022, "o", "\u001b[2m# get_file_contents only under acme/, so a capability with no repo constraint is wider: refused.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.760072, "o", "$ printf \"%s\\n\" demo-coder-secret | ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$PLANNER\" attenuo token exchange --actor coder --client-secret-stdin --cap github:get_file_contents\r\n"]
[1.772369, "o", "error: server answered 400 Bad Request: invalid_scope: delegation chain is invalid: hop 1 widens capabilities relative to hop 0: requested capability `github:get_file_contents` is not covered by the parent capability set\r\ndecision 9c0a73df-dbdc-405a-b42a-554f5a0c15dc\r\n"]
[1.777616, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 4. Exchange 2, planner -> coder (hop 2), narrowed at every point\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.777621, "o", "\u001b[2m# repo narrowed from acme/ to acme/api, a distinct limit of 1 on repo (one repository per run),\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.77764, "o", "\u001b[2m# no list_issues, no create_issue, and --no-delegation (may_act: []) so nobody may exchange it.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.777677, "o", "$ printf \"%s\\n\" demo-coder-secret | ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$PLANNER\" attenuo token exchange --actor coder --client-secret-stdin --no-delegation --ttl-seconds 600 --cap '{\"server\":\"github\",\"tool\":\"get_file_contents\",\"constraints\":{\"repo\":{\"op\":\"prefix\",\"value\":\"acme/api\"}},\"limits\":{\"distinct\":{\"arg\":\"repo\",\"max\":1}}}' --cap '{\"server\":\"github\",\"tool\":\"create_or_update_file\",\"constraints\":{\"repo\":{\"op\":\"prefix\",\"value\":\"acme/api\"}},\"limits\":{\"distinct\":{\"arg\":\"repo\",\"max\":1}}}'\r\n"]
[1.793597, "o", "lease       3090386e-f668-4159-95ec-09fd90d0ce14\r\nexpires_in  600s\r\n"]
[1.793721, "o", "token       eyJ0eXAiOiJhdHRlbnVvK2p3...\r\n"]
[1.79914, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 5. What the coder's token says: two hops, each narrower than the one above\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.799163, "o", "$ attenuo token inspect \"$CODER\" --verify\r\n"]
[1.80897, "o", "user alice  (issuer https://idp.example)\r\n  authenticated 2026-11-05T19:27:05Z\r\n└─ agent planner\r\n     can   github:create_issue {repo starts with \"acme/\"}, github:create_or_update_file {repo starts with \"acme/\"}, github:get_file_contents {repo starts with \"acme/\"}, github:list_issues {repo starts with \"acme/\"}\r\n     until 2026-11-05T19:42:05Z (in 14m 59s)\r\n     lease acac0825-a30c-4a56-a6ce-f78769186eb5\r\n   └─ agent coder  <- holds this token\r\n        can   github:create_or_update_file {repo starts with \"acme/api\"} [distinct repo <= 1], github:get_file_contents {repo starts with \"acme/api\"} [distinct repo <= 1]\r\n        until 2026-11-05T19:37:05Z (in 9m 59s)\r\n        lease 3090386e-f668-4159-95ec-09fd90d0ce14\r\n"]
[1.808978, "o", "\r\niss http://127.0.0.1:58247   aud attenuo   jti c1f4339e-c4b4-4778-8e73-4db155cdafa6\r\nkid nJtT89SYz0zeaak9TEgq3Q   ou_kid nJtT89SYz0zeaak9TEgq3Q\r\nexp 2026-11-05T19:37:05Z (in 9m 59s)\r\nmay_act []: no agent may exchange this token\r\nverified: signature, type, issuer, audience, expiry, chain\r\n"]
[1.811798, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 6. Exchange 3, refused: the coder tries to hand its token to a reviewer agent\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m# The reviewer authenticates fine, but the coder's token carries may_act: [].\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.81186, "o", "$ printf \"%s\\n\" demo-reviewer-secret | ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo token exchange --actor reviewer --client-secret-stdin --cap '{\"server\":\"github\",\"tool\":\"get_file_contents\",\"constraints\":{\"repo\":{\"op\":\"equals\",\"value\":\"acme/api\"}}}'\r\n"]
[1.823713, "o", "error: server answered 400 Bad Request: invalid_request: agent `reviewer` is not permitted to act on this token (may_act)\r\ndecision 70f00779-8bcd-4b48-9415-c6b7cd2e1ae3\r\n"]
[1.82864, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 7. The coder reads the file it was asked to fix: allowed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.828662, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --server github --tool get_file_contents --arg repo=acme/api --arg path=src/lib.rs\r\n"]
[1.839977, "o", "ALLOWED\r\n{\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"src/lib.rs\",\"repo\":\"acme/api\"},\"name\":\"get_file_contents\"}\r\n"]
[1.84239, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.842442, "o", "\u001b[1m== 8. The coder pushes its fix straight to main: denied by policy\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.84246, "o", "\u001b[2m# create_or_update_file on acme/api is in the coder's token; the policy wants an agent/* branch.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.842484, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --server github --tool create_or_update_file --arg repo=acme/api --arg path=src/lib.rs --arg branch=main --arg content=\"fn fixed() {}\"\r\n"]
[1.853128, "o", "DENIED  policy_deny\r\ndecision 17104261-8b16-4175-a99e-4854b1d73090\r\n"]
[1.858321, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 9. The coder tries to open an issue: denied, the planner never delegated create_issue\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.858345, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --server github --tool create_issue --arg repo=acme/api --arg title=\"fix pushed\"\r\n"]
[1.867759, "o", "DENIED  capability_denied\r\ndecision 73bb90d9-3992-4663-8c85-9b6b4cf0a516\r\n"]
[1.870597, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 10. The coder reads from a second repository under acme/api: denied by the run limit\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.8706, "o", "\u001b[2m# acme/api-client is inside the coder's repo prefix and the policy allows the read, but the\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.870624, "o", "\u001b[2m# distinct limit allows one repository per run and acme/api was the first.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.870643, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --server github --tool get_file_contents --arg repo=acme/api-client --arg path=README.md\r\n"]
[1.880105, "o", "DENIED  budget_exhausted\r\ndecision af96a9e9-7467-4124-898d-7cf454bab07a\r\n"]
[1.882432, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 11. The operator looks at the chain before acting\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.882455, "o", "\u001b[2m# The chain id is the planner's lease, the first hop's (also the chain_id of every audit record).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.882471, "o", "$ attenuo lease tree \"$PLANNER_LEASE\"\r\n"]
[1.89213, "o", "root lease (no ancestors)\r\nacac0825-a30c-4a56-a6ce-f78769186eb5  planner  active, expires 2026-11-05T19:32:05.884583Z  issued #1\r\n└─ 3090386e-f668-4159-95ec-09fd90d0ce14  coder  active, expires 2026-11-05T19:32:05.938128Z  issued #6\r\n        limit github/create_or_update_file distinct repo 0/1 (1 left)\r\n        limit github/get_file_contents distinct repo 1/1 (0 left)\r\nwould revoke 2 lease(s) if revoked now\r\n"]
[1.892327, "o", "$ attenuo lease revoke --chain-id \"$PLANNER_LEASE\" --preview\r\n"]
[1.901497, "o", "preview: nothing was changed\r\nselector  chain_id acac0825-a30c-4a56-a6ce-f78769186eb5\r\nmatched   2 lease(s)\r\nwould revoke 2 lease(s)\r\n  3090386e-f668-4159-95ec-09fd90d0ce14\r\n  acac0825-a30c-4a56-a6ce-f78769186eb5\r\n"]
[1.901697, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 12. The operator revokes the whole chain by chain_id\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.90172, "o", "$ attenuo lease revoke --chain-id \"$PLANNER_LEASE\" --reason \"planner run went wrong\"\r\n"]
[1.91095, "o", "selector  chain_id acac0825-a30c-4a56-a6ce-f78769186eb5\r\nmatched   2 lease(s)\r\nrevoked 2 lease(s)\r\n  3090386e-f668-4159-95ec-09fd90d0ce14\r\n  acac0825-a30c-4a56-a6ce-f78769186eb5\r\nreason    planner run went wrong\r\naudit     c013e8e5-ef9d-4537-a248-23f8f2e06097\r\n"]
[1.913064, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 13. The coder's next call, even the one that worked before, is denied\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.913087, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --server github --tool get_file_contents --arg repo=acme/api --arg path=src/lib.rs\r\n"]
[1.921325, "o", "DENIED  lease_revoked\r\ndecision 994e741c-5dac-4c9e-b93b-b2a320f94fa4\r\n"]
[1.923628, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 14. The audit log records every decision, and its hash chain checks out\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.923647, "o", "$ attenuo audit tail -n 50\r\n"]
[1.93406, "o", "#1    2026-11-05T19:27:05.884583Z  ALLOW attenuo/token.root  planner for alice  reason=token_issued  id=d7297cee-e75a-4330-8324-d073c2778128\r\n#2    2026-11-05T19:27:05.884583Z  ALLOW attenuo/admin.root_token  by urn:attenuo:admin  reason=admin_action  id=f031984d-0be9-470d-811f-3956c7e9c219\r\n#3    2026-11-05T19:27:05.901761Z  ALLOW github/list_issues  planner for alice  reason=policy_allow  id=1ba93c62-975b-44ac-ae24-b15bd9ac7e3d\r\n#4    2026-11-05T19:27:05.906585Z  tool_result  github/list_issues  planner for alice  decision=1ba93c62-975b-44ac-ae24-b15bd9ac7e3d  label=untrusted size=119  id=c061b9fb-3541-42ec-9e2d-08cff7f28139\r\n#5    2026-11-05T19:27:05.919973Z  DENY  attenuo/token.exchange  planner for alice  reason=exchange_widening  id=9c0a73df-dbdc-405a-b42a-554f5a0c15dc\r\n#6    2026-11-05T19:27:05.938128Z  ALLOW attenuo/token.exchange  planner > coder for alice  reason=token_issued  id=329b5023-d480-4c0e-8139-d9f5ffca84c4\r\n#7    2026-11-05T19:27:05.971831Z  DENY  attenuo/token.exchange  planner > coder fo"]
[1.934078, "o", "r alice  reason=exchange_actor_not_permitted  id=70f00779-8bcd-4b48-9415-c6b7cd2e1ae3\r\n#8    2026-11-05T19:27:05.986981Z  ALLOW github/get_file_contents  planner > coder for alice  reason=policy_allow  id=fe179ad3-bd9e-4daa-8fa2-5fb360bf556e\r\n#9    2026-11-05T19:27:05.989971Z  tool_result  github/get_file_contents  planner > coder for alice  decision=fe179ad3-bd9e-4daa-8fa2-5fb360bf556e  label=untrusted size=149  id=0c451b6f-9a0d-4d41-81a7-cfe7607e070e\r\n#10   2026-11-05T19:27:06.001738Z  DENY  github/create_or_update_file  planner > coder for alice  reason=policy_deny  id=17104261-8b16-4175-a99e-4854b1d73090\r\n#11   2026-11-05T19:27:06.017606Z  DENY  github/create_issue  planner > coder for alice  reason=capability_denied  id=73bb90d9-3992-4663-8c85-9b6b4cf0a516\r\n#12   2026-11-05T19:27:06.029155Z  DENY  github/get_file_contents  planner > coder for alice  reason=budget_exhausted  id=af96a9e9-7467-4124-898d-7cf454bab07a\r\n"]
[1.934082, "o", "#13   2026-11-05T19:27:06.060376Z  ALLOW attenuo/admin.lease.revoke  by urn:attenuo:admin  reason=admin_action  id=c013e8e5-ef9d-4537-a248-23f8f2e06097\r\n"]
[1.934086, "o", "#14   2026-11-05T19:27:06.071783Z  DENY  github/get_file_contents  planner > coder for alice  reason=lease_revoked  id=994e741c-5dac-4c9e-b93b-b2a320f94fa4\r\n"]
[1.934288, "o", "$ attenuo audit verify\r\n"]
[1.943468, "o", "audit chain OK: 14 entries verified\r\ncheckpoints: none signed yet\r\n"]
[1.945753, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 15. The refused widening exchange is in the log too\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.945774, "o", "\u001b[2m# A refused exchange whose subject token verified is a deny record against the parent's chain.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.945792, "o", "$ attenuo audit show --id \"$WIDEN_DECISION\"\r\n"]
[1.954488, "o", "#5    2026-11-05T19:27:05.919973Z  DENY  attenuo/token.exchange  planner for alice  reason=exchange_widening  id=9c0a73df-dbdc-405a-b42a-554f5a0c15dc\r\nkind        decision\r\nchain       acac0825-a30c-4a56-a6ce-f78769186eb5\r\nhash        538148825ffab32f1dc3974ce41b1b3d8da3dced8c718c5c96cef4af13935bda\r\nprev hash   14fe0fbba960bf2d8e298dc6d16284451d61978c6f0ca9c4e9eca900b9c5aa4c\r\nleases      (root first, as the registry sees them now)\r\n  acac0825-a30c-4a56-a6ce-f78769186eb5  REVOKED 2026-11-05T19:27:06.060376Z (planner run went wrong)\r\ncheckpoint  none yet: the entry is newer than every checkpoint, only the hash chain covers it\r\npolicy      not reloaded since this entry\r\n"]
[1.956743, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 16. The decision chain of the refused write\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.956768, "o", "\u001b[2m# The record names both hops, the policy that decided, the leases (revoked now) and its hashes.\u001b[0m\r\n$ attenuo audit show --id \"$WRITE_DECISION\"\r\n"]
[1.96532, "o", "#10   2026-11-05T19:27:06.001738Z  DENY  github/create_or_update_file  planner > coder for alice  reason=policy_deny  id=17104261-8b16-4175-a99e-4854b1d73090\r\nkind        decision\r\nchain       acac0825-a30c-4a56-a6ce-f78769186eb5\r\npolicies    no_writes_to_default_branch\r\nhash        2475954a60b09b109a818cee10e0bd89a94f4716962663a58cc61fa632b3ccd6\r\nprev hash   d5207b41cbd486388245bf361f0ef1a439104b32d47bd85614fa1f1cd324758b\r\nleases      (root first, as the registry sees them now)\r\n  acac0825-a30c-4a56-a6ce-f78769186eb5  REVOKED 2026-11-05T19:27:06.060376Z (planner run went wrong)\r\n  3090386e-f668-4159-95ec-09fd90d0ce14  REVOKED 2026-11-05T19:27:06.060376Z (planner run went wrong)\r\ncheckpoint  none yet: the entry is newer than every checkpoint, only the hash chain covers it\r\npolicy      not reloaded since this entry\r\n"]
[1.967651, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== What reached the GitHub server\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.97227, "o", "  fake-mcp: tools/call list_issues {\"repo\":\"acme/api\"}\r\n  fake-mcp: tools/call get_file_contents {\"path\":\"src/lib.rs\",\"repo\":\"acme/api\"}\r\n"]
[1.972469, "o", "  -> 2 tools/calls reached upstream (the planner's list and the coder's read). The four denied calls never left attenuo.\r\n"]
[1.975913, "x", "0"]
